---

<BaseLayout
  title="Impact"
  description="The Bluffline converts non-motorized connectivity into safety, economic, and quality of life value for Pensacola and Northwest Florida."
>
  <PageHero
    label="Impact"
    title="Transforming connectivity into community value"
    description="The Bluffline converts non-motorized connectivity into safety, economic development, and quality of life improvements for Pensacola and Northwest Florida."
  />

  <!-- Safety & Access Section -->
  <section class="section safety-section" id="safety">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Safety & Access</span>
        <h2>A safer corridor for everyone</h2>
        <p>Florida consistently ranks among the most dangerous states for pedestrians and cyclists. Within the Bluffline corridor, the lack of safe infrastructure forces people walking and biking onto high-speed roads designed exclusively for motor vehicles.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-row">
        {safetyStats.map((stat) => (
          <IconCard
            statHighlight={stat.value}
            description={stat.description}
            sourceUrl={stat.sourceUrl}
            sourceLabel={stat.sourceLabel}
            variant="stat"
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Safety Map Section -->
  <section class="map-section">
    <div class="map-wrapper" id="safety-map-wrapper">
      <div id="safety-map"></div>
      <div class="map-controls">
        <button class="map-control-btn" id="fullscreen-btn" aria-label="Toggle fullscreen map">
          <svg class="icon-expand" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
            <polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline>
            <line x1="21" y1="3" x2="14" y2="10"></line>
            <line x1="3" y1="21" x2="10" y2="14"></line>
          </svg>
          <svg class="icon-collapse" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="4 14 10 14 10 20"></polyline>
            <polyline points="20 10 14 10 14 4"></polyline>
            <line x1="14" y1="10" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
            <line x1="3" y1="21" x2="10" y2="14"></line>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="map-control-btn view-toggle" id="view-toggle-btn" aria-label="Toggle map view">
          <svg class="icon-points" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
            <circle cx="19" cy="5" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="5" cy="5" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2"></circle>
          </svg>
          <svg class="icon-heatmap" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" opacity="0.3"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" opacity="0.5"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
          </svg>
          <span class="toggle-label">Show Points</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="map-legend" id="map-legend">
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-polygon"></div>
          <span>Bluffline Corridor</span>
        </div>
        <div class="legend-heatmap">
          <div class="legend-item legend-heatmap-item">
            <div class="legend-heatmap-block">
              <div class="legend-heatmap-gradient"></div>
              <div class="legend-heatmap-labels">
                <span>Low</span>
                <span>High</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span>Crash Density</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="legend-points" style="display: none;">
          <div class="legend-item">
            <div class="legend-fatal"></div>
            <span>Fatality</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <div class="legend-serious"></div>
            <span>Serious Injury</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <div class="legend-injury"></div>
            <span>Injury</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-divider"></div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <div class="legend-shape-circle"></div>
            <span>Pedestrian</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-item">
            <div class="legend-shape-square"></div>
            <span>Cyclist</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="map-context">
      <p class="map-caption">Pedestrian and cyclist crashes within and adjacent to the Bluffline planning corridor (2022-2025). The Bluffline will provide a safe, separated alternative to these high-risk roads.</p>
      <p class="map-source">Data: <a href="https://s4.geoplan.ufl.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Signal Four Analytics</a>, Florida Department of Transportation</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Safety Context Section -->
  <section class="section context-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="context-grid">
        <div class="context-content">
          <h3>The problem: Roads designed for cars, not people</h3>
          <p>The Pensacola metro area's road network was designed primarily for high-speed motor vehicle traffic. Wide lanes, minimal sidewalks, and nonexistent bike infrastructure force pedestrians and cyclists into dangerous situations.</p>
          <p>Smart Growth America's "Dangerous by Design" report consistently ranks Florida among the deadliest states for people walking. Nine of the top 20 most dangerous metropolitan areas for pedestrians are located in Florida.</p>
          <p>The consequences are stark: within the Bluffline corridor alone, 271 crashes involving pedestrians and cyclists have occurred since 2022—resulting in 11 deaths and 268 injuries, including 28 serious injuries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="context-content">
          <h3>The solution: Separated infrastructure saves lives</h3>
          <p>Research consistently shows that separated greenways and trails dramatically reduce injury rates for pedestrians and cyclists. Off-road facilities reduce crash rates by up to 60% compared to on-street facilities.</p>
          <p>The Bluffline provides this separated infrastructure—utilizing abandoned rail corridors, utility rights-of-way, and existing public land to create continuous, car-free connections throughout the corridor.</p>
          <p>Beyond preventing crashes, the Bluffline enables a transportation option for the many Pensacola residents who cannot drive, cannot afford a car, or simply choose not to use one for every trip.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Economic Development Section -->
  <section class="section economic-section" id="economic">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Economic Development</span>
        <h2>Converting connectivity into economic value</h2>
        <p>Decades of research demonstrate that trail infrastructure generates significant economic returns—from increased property values and tourism spending to job creation and reduced healthcare costs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="research-highlight">
        {researchHighlights.map((stat) => (
          <IconCard
            statHighlight={stat.value}
            description={stat.description}
            sourceUrl={stat.sourceUrl}
            sourceLabel={stat.sourceLabel}
            variant="stat-highlight"
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Economic Pillars Section -->
  <section class="section pillars-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="pillars-grid">
        {pillarCards.map((card) => (
          <IconCard
            icon={card.icon}
            title={card.title}
            description={card.description}
            stats={card.stats}
            detail={card.detail}
            variant="pillar"
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Research Evidence Section -->
  <section class="section evidence-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="evidence-header">
        <h2>Proven returns from peer projects</h2>
        <p>Trail projects across the country demonstrate consistent economic returns. Here's what similar investments have achieved.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="evidence-grid">
        {evidenceCards.map((card) => (
          <IconCard
            title={card.title}
            location={card.location}
            stats={card.stats}
            sourceUrl={card.sourceUrl}
            sourceLabel={card.sourceLabel}
            variant="evidence"
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quality of Life Section -->
  <section class="section quality-section" id="quality">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header light">
        <span class="section-label light">Quality of Life</span>
        <h2>Building a healthier, more connected community</h2>
        <p>Beyond economic metrics, the Bluffline creates fundamental improvements to daily life—healthier residents, stronger neighborhoods, and expanded access to nature and recreation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="quality-grid">
        {qualityCards.map((card) => (
          <IconCard
            icon={card.icon}
            title={card.title}
            description={card.description}
            sourceUrl={card.sourceUrl}
            sourceLabel={card.sourceLabel}
            variant="dark"
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CallToAction
    title="Help us build the Bluffline"
    description="Every mile of safe trail infrastructure prevents injuries, creates jobs, and improves quality of life. Join us in making the Bluffline a reality."
    primaryLabel="Get Involved"
    primaryHref="/support"
    secondaryLabel="See Our Progress"
    secondaryHref="/progress"
    variant="forest"
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Section styling */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .section { padding: 6rem 0; }
  }
  .section-inner {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }
  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .section-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .section-header.light h2,
  .section-header.light p {
    color: white;
  }
  .section-header.light p {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .section-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--forest);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .section-label.light {
    color: var(--spring);
  }

  /* Safety Section */
  .safety-section {
    background: var(--warm-white);
  }
  .stats-row {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .stats-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .stats-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }

  /* Map Section */
  .map-section { background: var(--mist); padding: 0; }
  .map-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    height: 60vh;
    min-height: 400px;
    background: var(--mist);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .map-wrapper {
      height: 65vh;
      min-height: 450px;
      max-height: 600px;
    }
  }
